    {"hint.encounter.db.hint_monster_friendly", "That monster is friendly to you and will attack your enemies. You can command your allies by pressing {shout_key}.", "那只怪物对你友善，会攻击你的敌人。按下{shout_key}可以指挥盟友。", "shout_key:key_markup"},
    {"hint.encounter.db.hint_monster_left_los", "{monster} didn't vanish, but merely moved onto a square which you can't currently see. It's still nearby, unless something happens to it in the short amount of time it's out of sight.", "{monster}并未消失，只是移动到了你目前看不见的格子。它仍在附近，除非趁你看不见的这段时间发生了什么。", "monster:name"},
    {"hint.encounter.db.hint_monster_no_shout", "Uh-oh, that monster noticed you! Fortunately, it didn't make any noise, but many monsters do make noise when they notice you. That will alert other monsters in the area, who will come to check out what the commotion was about.", "糟了，那只怪物注意到你了！幸好它没有发出声响，但许多怪物注意到你时都会叫喊。这会惊动附近的其他怪物，它们会赶来查看发生了什么。", ""},
    {"hint.encounter.db.hint_monster_shouted_seen", "Uh-oh, that monster noticed you! Plus, the noise it made will alert other monsters in the vicinity, who will come to check out what the commotion was about.", "糟了，那只怪物注意到你了！它发出的声响还会惊动附近的其他怪物，它们会赶来查看发生了什么。", ""},
    {"hint.encounter.db.hint_monster_shouted_unseen", "Uh-oh, some monster noticed you, either one that's around a corner or one that's invisible. Plus, the noise it made will alert other monsters in the vicinity, who will come to check out what the commotion was about.", "糟了，有只怪物注意到了你——它可能躲在拐角后，也可能隐形了。它发出的声响还会惊动附近的其他怪物，它们会赶来查看发生了什么。", ""},
    {"hint.encounter.db.hint_monster_unusual", "That monster looks a bit unusual. You might wish to examine it a bit more closely by <localtiles>hovering your mouse over its tile.</localtiles> <nomouse>pressing {look_key} and moving the cursor onto its square.</nomouse>", "那只怪物看起来有些特别。你或许可以仔细看看：<localtiles>将鼠标悬停在它所在的格子上。</localtiles> <nomouse>按下{look_key}并将光标移到它所在的格子。</nomouse>", "look_key:key_markup"},
    {"hint.encounter.db.hint_seen_zero_exp_mon", "That<console> {glyph}</console> is {monster}. While <w>technically</w> a monster, it's more like dungeon furniture, since it's harmless and doesn't move. If it's in your way you can attack and kill it like other monsters, but you won't get any experience for doing so.", "那<console> {glyph}</console>是{monster}。虽然<w>从技术上说</w>它是怪物，但更像地牢里的摆设，因为它无害且不会移动。若它挡路，你可以像攻击其他怪物那样杀死它，但不会获得经验。", "glyph:text;monster:name"},
    {"hint.encounter.db.hint_temporarily_friendly", "However, it is only <w>temporarily</w> friendly, and will become dangerous again when this friendliness wears off.", "不过它只是<w>暂时</w>友善，友善状态消退后又会变得危险。", ""},
    {"hint.encounter.first.console", "That {glyph} is a monster, usually depicted by a letter. Some typical early monsters look like <brown>r</brown>, <green>l</green>, <brown>K</brown> or <lightgrey>g</lightgrey>. You can gain information about it by pressing <w>x</w> and moving the cursor over the monster, and read the monster description by then pressing <w>v</w>. \nTo attack this monster with your wielded weapon, just move into it. ", "{glyph}是一个怪物，通常以字母表示。常见的初级怪物包括<brown>r</brown>、<green>l</green>、<brown>K</brown>或<lightgrey>g</lightgrey>。按<w>x</w>并将光标移到怪物上可以查看信息，再按<w>v</w>可阅读怪物描述。 \n要用手持武器攻击它，只需朝它移动。 ", "glyph:text"},
    {"hint.encounter.first.console_list", "That {glyph} is a monster, usually depicted by a letter. Some typical early monsters look like <brown>r</brown>, <green>l</green>, <brown>K</brown> or <lightgrey>g</lightgrey>. Your console settings allowing, you'll always see a list of monsters somewhere on the screen.\nYou can gain information about it by pressing <w>x</w> and moving the cursor over the monster, and read the monster description by then pressing <w>v</w>. \nTo attack this monster with your wielded weapon, just move into it. ", "{glyph}是一个怪物，通常以字母表示。常见的初级怪物包括<brown>r</brown>、<green>l</green>、<brown>K</brown>或<lightgrey>g</lightgrey>。只要控制台设置允许，屏幕上总会显示一份怪物列表。\n按<w>x</w>并将光标移到怪物上可以查看信息，再按<w>v</w>可阅读怪物描述。 \n要用手持武器攻击它，只需朝它移动。 ", "glyph:text"},
    {"hint.encounter.first.tiles", "That monster is {monster}. You can learn about any monster by hovering your mouse over it, and read its description by <w>right-clicking</w> on it.\nTo attack this monster with your wielded weapon, just move into it. Note that as long as there's a non-friendly monster in view you won't be able to automatically move to distant squares, to avoid death by misclicking.", "那只怪物是{monster}。将鼠标悬停在怪物上可以了解它，<w>右键点击</w>则可阅读它的描述。\n要用手持武器攻击它，只需朝它移动。只要视野中有非友善怪物，为避免误操作导致死亡，你就无法自动移动到较远的格子。", "monster:name"},
    {"hint.encounter.glyph", "<{colour}>{glyph}</{colour}>", "<{colour}>{glyph}</{colour}>", "colour:colour;glyph:key_markup"},
    {"hint.encounter.hunter.ready", "However, as a hunter you will want to deal with it using your bow. If you have a look at your shortbow from your <w>i</w>nventory, you'll find an explanation of how to do this. <tiles>Clicking with your <w>right mouse button</w> on your shortbow will also let you read its description.</tiles>", "不过，作为猎人，你会想用弓来对付它。查看物品<w>i</w>栏中的短弓，就能看到如何使用弓的说明。<tiles>用鼠标<w>右键</w>点击短弓也能阅读其描述。</tiles>", ""},
    {"hint.encounter.hunter.wield", "However, as a hunter you will want to deal with it using your bow. If you have a look at your shortbow from your <w>i</w>nventory, you'll find an explanation of how to do this. First <w>w</w>ield it, then follow the instructions.<tiles>\nAs a short-cut you can also <w>right-click</w> on your shortbow to read its description, and <w>left-click</w> to wield it.</tiles>", "不过，作为猎人，你会想用弓来对付它。查看物品<w>i</w>栏中的短弓，就能看到如何使用弓的说明。先<w>w</w>装备它，再按说明操作。<tiles>你也可以<w>右键点击</w>短弓阅读其描述，并<w>左键点击</w>来装备它。</tiles>", ""},
    {"hint.encounter.magic", "However, as a conjurer you will want to deal with it using magic. If you look at the help entry for the <w>M</w>emorisation screen you'll find an explanation of how to do this.", "不过，作为咒法师，你会想用魔法来对付它。查看<w>M</w>记忆界面的帮助条目，就能看到如何使用魔法的说明。", ""},
    {"hints.pickup.first_object", "That <console>$1 </console>is an item. If you move there and press <input>$cmd[CMD_PICKUP]</input><localtiles>, or <input>left-click</input> on it in your inventory</localtiles>, you will pick it up.<console> Generally, items are shown by non-letter symbols like <w>%\?!\"=()[</w>.</console> Some objects<tiles>, marked with a green frame,</tiles> will be picked up automatically.\n\nOnce it is in your inventory, you can drop it again with <localtiles>a <input>Shift-left-click</input>. Whenever you <input>right-click</input> on an item</localtiles><console><input>$cmd[CMD_DROP]</input>. Any time you look at an item in your inventory (<input>$cmd[CMD_DISPLAY_INVENTORY]</input>)</console>, you can read about its properties and its description.\n", "那边<console>$1 </console>是一个物品。移动到它旁边并按下 <input>$cmd[CMD_PICKUP]</input><localtiles>，或者在背包中对它<input>单击鼠标左键</input></localtiles>，即可拾取。<console>通常，物品会以非字母符号显示，例如 <w>%\?!\"=()[</w>。</console>有些物品<tiles>会以绿色边框标出，</tiles>并自动拾取。\n\n物品进入背包后，你可以用<localtiles><input>Shift-鼠标左键</input>再次将它丢下。每当你<input>对物品单击鼠标右键</input></localtiles><console><input>$cmd[CMD_DROP]</input>。查看背包中的物品时（<input>$cmd[CMD_DISPLAY_INVENTORY]</input>）</console>，你可以阅读它的属性和说明。\n", ""},
