    {"monster.detail.lore.acid_blob_current", "A lump of sickly pustulent flesh, dripping with lethal acid.", "一坨长满肉瘤的恶心肉块，不断滴落着致命的强酸。", ""},
    {"monster.detail.lore.hydra_current", "A great and nightmarish lacertilian beast. It has many heads, and the potential to grow many more!\n\nHitting it with any bladed weapon bigger than a short blade risks lopping a head off and causing two more to grow in its place. Very large claws, such as trolls', are long enough to do the same. Only a weapon branded with flame will cauterise the wound and prevent more heads from growing.", "一头噩梦般的巨型蜥蜴类怪兽。它有很多个头，而且可能还会长出更多！\n\n用任何比短刃更大的有刃武器击打它，都有可能砍掉一个头，并在原处长出另外两个。像巨魔那样的大爪子也足够长，同样会造成这种结果。只有带有火焰印记的武器才能灼烧伤口，阻止它长出更多头。", ""},
    {"monster.detail.lore.jiangshi_current", "A vampiric thrall bound into servitude by esoteric rituals. Though its rigid limbs give it an awkward gait, it moves with surprising speed, leaping upon its victims and leeching away their life essence with its vicious claws.", "被神秘仪式束缚、沦为吸血奴仆的怪物。尽管僵硬的四肢使它步态笨拙，它的行动却出奇迅速，会扑向受害者，用凶狠的爪子吸取其生命精华。", ""},
    {"monster.detail.lore.orc_warrior_current", "An experienced, armoured and well-armed orc soldier, able to command a small mob of its fellows.", "这是一名经验丰富、披甲且装备精良的兽人士兵，能指挥一小群同类。", ""},
    {"monster.detail.melting", "It is quickly melting away.", "正在迅速融化。", ""},
    {"monster.detail.no_reward", "Killing this monster yields no experience or items.", "杀死该怪物不会获得经验或物品。", ""},
