    {"monster.draconian.desc.black", "Sparks flare out of its mouth and nostrils.", "它的口鼻处迸出火花。", ""},
    {"monster.draconian.desc.green", "Venom drips from its jaws and stinger tail.", "毒液从它的颚部和带刺尾巴滴落。", ""},
    {"monster.draconian.desc.grey", "Its scales and tail are adapted to the water.", "它的鳞片和尾巴适于水中生活。", ""},
    {"monster.draconian.desc.pale", "It is cloaked in a pall of superheated steam.", "它笼罩在一团过热蒸汽之中。", ""},
    {"monster.draconian.desc.purple", "Its outline shimmers with magical energy.", "它的轮廓闪烁着魔法能量。", ""},
    {"monster.draconian.desc.red", "Smoke pours from its nostrils.", "浓烟从它的鼻孔中涌出。", ""},
    {"monster.draconian.desc.white", "Frost pours from its nostrils.", "寒气从它的鼻孔中涌出。", ""},
    {"monster.draconian.desc.yellow", "Acidic fumes swirl around it.", "酸性烟雾在它周围盘旋。", ""},
