    {"monster.event.wyrmbane", "<green>Wyrmbane glows as a worthy foe approaches.</green>", "<green>值得一战的强敌逼近，Wyrmbane发出光芒。</green>", ""},
    {"monster.habitat.lava_travel", "It can travel through lava.", "可在熔岩中穿行。", ""},
