    {"monster.special.program_bug", "If this monster is a \"program bug\", then it's recommended that you save your game and reload. Please report monsters who masquerade as program bugs or run around the dungeon without a proper description to the authorities.", "如果这只怪物是“程序错误”，建议先保存游戏并重新载入。若遇到伪装成程序错误，或在地牢中游荡却没有正确描述的怪物，请向相关人员报告。", ""},
