    {"speech.monspeak.1389025fa3b699c2", "cowering in terror", "在恐惧中蜷缩", ""},
    {"speech.monspeak.138b3db0c88499a5", "{the_monster_1} says, \"At least there aren't any garudas. I hate garudas.\"", "{the_monster_1}说：“至少这儿没有迦楼罗。我讨厌迦楼罗。”", "the_monster_1:name"},
