    {"speech.monspeak.1564e2734fda03fd", "{the_monster_1} says, \"Why not join one of those new, up-and-coming flame gods instead\?\"", "{the_monster_1}说：“为什么不改信那些新冒头、有前途的火焰神呢？”", "the_monster_1:name"},
    {"speech.monspeak.1570cd204311da1b", "{the_monster_1} mutters a nigh-unspeakable word.", "{the_monster_1}咕哝出一个几乎无法说出口的词。", "the_monster_1:name"},
