    {"speech.monspeak.16610f90db80f21e", "{the_monster_1} says, \"I heard that the world ends if you bring it to the surface.\"", "{the_monster_1}说：“我听说你要是把它带到地面，世界就会毁灭。”", "the_monster_1:name"},
    {"speech.monspeak.1662d6c7e9c40c8c", "{the_monster_1} says, \"I wish they'd hurry up and stop blocking the corridors.\"", "{the_monster_1}说：“真希望他们快点让开，别总堵着走廊。”", "the_monster_1:name"},
    {"speech.monspeak.166449092a92c846", "{channel_1}{the_monster_possessive_1} plumage briefly flares with an otherworldly flame.", "{channel_1}{the_monster_possessive_1}羽毛短暂地燃起一阵异界的火焰。", "channel_1:key;the_monster_possessive_1:name"},
    {"speech.monspeak.1674bcaf0a931098", "{channel_1}A cold fog rises from {the_monster_1}.", "{channel_1}一股寒雾从{the_monster_1}升起。", "channel_1:key;the_monster_1:name"},
    {"speech.monspeak.167ac635baa35920", "{the_monster_1} says, \"Och, ye'r asking fur it now.\"", "{the_monster_1}说：“哎呀，你这是自找的。”", "the_monster_1:name"},
    {"speech.monspeak.168d0cc382296a7b", "{the_monster_1} says, \"I've ne'er se'n tha particular type o' rock formation 'fore.\"", "{the_monster_1}说：“俺以前从没见过这种岩层。”", "the_monster_1:name"},
    {"speech.monspeak.169495a19e7cbdca", "{the_monster_1} says, \"If you wanted the light to be dimmer, you could have said so.\"", "{the_monster_1}说：“你要是想让光暗一点，早说啊。”", "the_monster_1:name"},
    {"speech.monspeak.16a7ee4b6234bdff", "{the_monster_1} says {to_foe_1}, \"How do the people who live here stand the isolation\?\"", "{the_monster_1}说 {to_foe_1}：“住在这里的人是怎么忍受这种与世隔绝的？”", "the_monster_1:name;to_foe_1:text"},
    {"speech.monspeak.16c625b24908257b", "{the_monster_1} mumbles something strange.", "{the_monster_1}咕哝着一些奇怪的东西。", "the_monster_1:name"},
    {"speech.monspeak.16fb29c6fa30dc4c", "awesome", "了不起的", ""},
