    {"speech.monspeak.1702e44ccdecf291", "{the_monster_1} grins. \"Soon, every apiary\\'s gonna want a piece of Sprozz!\"", "{the_monster_1}咧嘴一笑。“很快，每一座蜂场都会想要一件斯普罗兹出品！”", "the_monster_1:name"},
    {"speech.monspeak.170b385339209576", "{the_monster_1} laughs evilly.", "{the_monster_1}邪恶地大笑。", "the_monster_1:name"},
    {"speech.monspeak.1712aa4239d4a7bc", "{the_monster_1} says, \"This isn't the end, it's only just beginning!\"", "{the_monster_1}说：“这不是结束，这仅仅是个开始！”", "the_monster_1:name"},
    {"speech.monspeak.1713da1ffa822538", "{the_monster_1} says {to_foe_1}, \"I'm really upset.\"", "{the_monster_1}说 {to_foe_1}：“我很不高兴。”", "the_monster_1:name;to_foe_1:text"},
