    {"speech.monspeak.17eb4d8ff21e8962", "{the_monster_1} says, \"Imagine how many trees were cut down to fuel your hobby.\"", "{the_monster_1}说：“想想为了你的爱好，有多少树被砍倒了。”", "the_monster_1:name"},
