    {"speech.monspeak.27e56bed35474b3e", "{the_monster_1} says {to_foe_1}, \"My wife will appreciate not having to wash blood out of my clothes anymore.\"", "{the_monster_1}说 {to_foe_1}：“我妻子会很高兴再也不用从我的衣服上洗血迹了。”", "the_monster_1:name;to_foe_1:text"},
