    {"speech.monspeak.5a2a8dc48315da5a", "{the_monster_1} draws Wrath. \"So many ways gods can punish you!\"", "{the_monster_1}抽到了愤怒。“神明惩罚你的办法可真多！”", "the_monster_1:name"},
