    {"speech.monspeak.5fa12d45351337ee", "{the_monster_1} says, \"I'm soaked through. I hate being wet!\"", "{the_monster_1}说：“我浑身湿透了。我讨厌浑身湿透！”", "the_monster_1:name"},
