    {"speech.monspeak.ede156beb1c1e670", "{the_monster_1} asks, \"Is it over\? Can I wake up now\?\"", "{the_monster_1}问道：“都结束了吗？我现在能醒过来了吗？”", "the_monster_1:name"},
