    {"speech.monspeak.ee6a4bd3e66c17f4", "{the_monster_1} says, \"Isn't that thing heavy\? I could take a turn.\"", "{the_monster_1}说：“那东西不沉吗？我可以替你扛一会儿。”", "the_monster_1:name"},
