    {"target.monster.here", "<cyan>Here:</cyan> {description}", "<cyan>此处：</cyan>{description}", "description:text"},
    {"target.monster.hint.berserk", "A berserking monster is bloodthirsty and fighting madly. Such a blood rage makes it particularly dangerous!\n\n", "狂暴的怪物嗜血而疯狂地战斗。这种血怒会令它格外危险！\n\n", ""},
    {"target.monster.hint.distracted", "Apparently it has been distracted by something. You could use this opportunity to sneak up on this monster - or to sneak away.", "它似乎被什么东西分散了注意力。你可以趁机悄悄接近它，也可以悄悄离开。", ""},
    {"target.monster.hint.exclusion", "You can easily mark its square as dangerous to avoid accidentally entering into its field of view when using auto-explore or auto-travel. To do so, enter targeting mode with <w>x</w> and then press <w>e</w> when your cursor is hovering over the monster's grid. Doing so will mark this grid and all surrounding ones within a radius of 8 as \"excluded\" ones that explore or travel modes won't enter.", "你可以轻松地将它所在的格子标记为危险区域，避免使用自动探索或自动旅行时不慎进入它的视野。操作方法：按<w>x</w>进入瞄准模式，将光标移到怪物所在格后按<w>e</w>。这样会将该格及其半径8格范围内的所有格子标记为“排除”；自动探索和自动旅行不会进入这些格子。", ""},
    {"target.monster.hint.flee", "This might be a good time to run away.", "现在或许是逃跑的好时机。", ""},
    {"target.monster.hint.flee.berserk", "This might be a good time to run away or apply your Berserk <w>a</w>bility.", "现在或许是逃跑或使用狂暴<w>a</w>能力的好时机。", ""},
    {"target.monster.hint.friendly", "Friendly monsters will follow you around and attempt to aid you in battle. You can order nearby allies by <w>t</w>alking to them.", "友善的怪物会跟随你，并在战斗中试图助你一臂之力。你可以通过与附近的盟友交谈来下达命令（按<w>t</w>）。", ""},
    {"target.monster.hint.ghost", "The ghost of a deceased adventurer, it would like nothing better than to send you the same way.\n\n", "这是某位已故冒险者的鬼魂，它最想做的事莫过于送你去和它作伴。\n\n", ""},
    {"target.monster.hint.nasty", "This monster appears to be really dangerous!\n", "这只怪物看起来极其危险！\n", ""},
    {"target.monster.hint.no_stats", "\nThis monster doesn't appear to have any resistances or susceptibilities. It cannot fly and is of average speed. Examining other, possibly more high-level monsters can give important clues as to how to deal with them.", "\n这只怪物似乎没有任何抗性或弱点。它不能飞，速度也很普通。查看其他可能更强大的怪物，能帮助你找到应对它们的办法。", ""},
    {"target.monster.hint.style", "\n<{colour}>{body}</{colour}>", "\n<{colour}>{body}</{colour}>", "colour:colour;body:text"},
    {"target.monster.hint.temporary", "\n\nHowever, it is only <w>temporarily</w> friendly, and will become dangerous again when this friendliness wears off.", "\n\n不过，它只是<w>暂时</w>对你友善；友善状态消退后，它又会变得危险。", ""},
    {"target.monster.hint.tough", "This monster appears to be quite dangerous.\n", "这只怪物看起来相当危险。\n", ""},
    {"target.monster.hint.unaware", "Apparently it has not noticed you - yet. Note that you do not have to engage every monster you meet. Sometimes, discretion is the better part of valour.", "它似乎还没发现你……至少目前如此。记住，你不必和遇到的每只怪物交战。有时，明哲保身才是上策。", ""},
    {"target.monster.hint.unique", "Did you think you were the only adventurer in the dungeon\? Well, you thought wrong! These unique adversaries often possess skills that normal monsters wouldn't, so be careful.\n\n", "你以为地牢里只有你一个冒险者吗？那可就想错了！这些独特的敌人往往拥有普通怪物不具备的能力，务必小心。\n\n", ""},
