    {"detail.monster.lore", "<master elementalist>", "monster.lore.grandmaster_elementalist"},
    {"detail.monster.lore", "A balloon-like sac of slime mold spores, suspended in a nutrient slurry to\nsustain them on their search for a new home. To the great misfortune of any\nadventurers in the vicinity, this slurry is also a highly potent acid.", "monster.lore.caustic_sporangium"},
    {"detail.monster.lore", "A beneficent remnant of the countless mortal knights who serve the Shining One.\nTheir hosts' role in the divine hierarchy is to guide and direct their legions\nin righteous moral warfare, though they may also call upon those mortals to\ndefend themselves.", "monster.lore.fravashi"},
    {"detail.monster.lore", "A cantankerous dwarf wearing a stupid-looking hat. He eyes you sourly, as if\ndeciding exactly how much offence he should take to the way you're staring at\nit.", "monster.lore.wiglaf"},
    {"detail.monster.lore", "A churning mass of flowing blood that throbs to the beat of an absent heart.\n\nDoes it wish to bury itself in your arteries because it recognises, on some\nprimordial level, that this is where it belongs\? Alas, all it is capable of in\nthis fleeing moment of sentience is violence.", "monster.lore.erythrospite"},
    {"detail.monster.lore", "A clashing tempest of boundless energy, channelling into capacitor jewels. Its\nwhirls of fire and ice occasionally escape and ricochet wildly off of walls.", "monster.lore.thermic_dynamo"},
    {"detail.monster.lore", "A common dungeon pest that combines the worst features of a scavenging insect\nand a looming deadline.\n\nTime flows strangely around it, rewinding any injuries inflicted upon it unless\nthe source of them is near enough to be caught up in its timestream.", "monster.lore.clockroach"},
    {"detail.monster.lore", "A conniving demon born from the nightmares of sleeping mages. It delights in\ncoaxing the imagined fears of mortals into reality.", "monster.lore.drude"},
    {"detail.monster.lore", "A crackling weapon formed of condensed magical energy. It can cut through entire\nrows of adversaries whenever its creator lands a melee attack.", "monster.lore.rending_blade"},
    {"detail.monster.lore", "A cruel and unruly brute who growls in the language of the untamed. Its very\npresence provokes and overworks non-sapient, living beasts and slimes alike into\na rapid fervour.", "monster.lore.ironbound_beastmaster"},
    {"detail.monster.lore", "A curious quadraped, resembling a cross between an armadillo and a yaktaur.", "monster.lore.armataur"},
    {"detail.monster.lore", "A deeply unfortunate soul mostly processed into crystal by some malevolent tear\nin reality. Ethereal reflections of its past and future suffering are cast upon\nnearby surfaces and foes.", "monster.lore.screaming_refraction"},
    {"detail.monster.lore", "A demon born of mortal envy, its flesh undulating with a sickening wetness\nwhenever it moves. It is driven by a singular desire to reduce all beauty to a\nform as hideous as its own.", "monster.lore.zykzyl"},
    {"detail.monster.lore", "A durable barricade made of ice reinforced with forgecraft magic. A lattice of\nprecise hairline cracks are visible just beneath its surface which allow it to\nfracture into a barrage of razor-sharp projectiles whenever it sustains critical\ndamage.", "monster.lore.splinterfrost_barricade"},
    {"detail.monster.lore", "A faceless stone bat unearthed from infernal chasms. Devilish beasts hunt in its\nwake.", "monster.lore.obsidian_bat"},
    {"detail.monster.lore", "A favoured child of Beogh, once not so unlike yourself.\n\nNow that you have proven yourself to them, they will fight and die for both you\nand the cause. Shepherd them well.", "monster.lore.orc_apostle_follower"},
    {"detail.monster.lore", "A fearsome aged hybrid with a woman's head, a lion's body, and the wings of\nan eagle. It solemnly guards the temples and treasures of the Dungeon with a\nmultitude of mind-clouding maledictions.", "monster.lore.guardian_sphinx"},
    {"detail.monster.lore", "A featureless silhouette of your own body, moving independently through the\ndivine power of Dithmenos. No matter how many times it is struck down, it will\nreform itself, for a shadow is inextinguishable so long as whatever cast it\nremains.", "monster.lore.shadow"},
    {"detail.monster.lore", "A flying munitions factory, held aloft on jets of fiery exhaust and packed to\nthe brim with explosives. It can rapidly fill an area with bomblets, and when\ncommanded by its creator, will explode them all (and itself) to devastating\neffect.", "monster.lore.monarch_bomb"},
    {"detail.monster.lore", "A former beekeeper's apprentice with an ambitious dream: to modernise the whole\nworld's beekeeping industry with the smooth certainty of disease-proof metal.\nHis methods may be questionable and his goals dubious, but his prototype's\nstinger still looks awfully sharp...", "monster.lore.sprozz"},
    {"detail.monster.lore", "A ghostly trickster that is fond of possessing small objects and making them\nfly noisily through the air.", "monster.lore.poltergeist"},
    {"detail.monster.lore", "A gleaming warrior, wrought from precious metals and the very pinnacle of\nforgecraft techniques. Its every motion flows with a deadly, fluid grace that\nbelies its artifical nature.", "monster.lore.platinum_paragon"},
    {"detail.monster.lore", "A glimmering spark of magical energy. It seeks out nearby enemies to expend\nitself upon, dealing damage and pushing them backwards.\n\nIt does not block its allies' line of fire.", "monster.lore.shooting_star"},
    {"detail.monster.lore", "A globe of deepest cold, still lingering from a time before the stars lit the\nheavens. It can shroud the soul in a chill so intense that even the gods cannot\nreach it.", "monster.lore.orb_of_winter"},
    {"detail.monster.lore", "A globe of profound nothingness and the oblivion that awaits all things - flesh,\nsouls, and even time itself. When the universe ends, only these will remain.", "monster.lore.orb_of_entropy"},
    {"detail.monster.lore", "A goblin newly converted to Nemelex Xobeh. It's still learning about all the\ncards and, thankfully, isn't inclined to use them against you.", "monster.lore.goblin_sharper"},
    {"detail.monster.lore", "A great and nightmarish lacertilian beast. It has many heads, and the potential to grow many more!\n\nHitting it with any bladed weapon bigger than a short blade risks lopping a head off and causing two more to grow in its place. Very large claws, such as trolls', are long enough to do the same. Only a weapon branded with flame will cauterise the wound and prevent more heads from growing.", "monster.detail.lore.hydra_current"},
    {"detail.monster.lore", "A heavily ruptured stonework, surrounded by rubble.", "monster.lore.pile_of_debris"},
    {"detail.monster.lore", "A hovering horror, rare and unnatural even amongst servitor eyes, radiating\nbaleful energies. They monitor the flow of chaotic life and ever-present death\nfor the divine Jiyva.", "monster.lore.eye_of_draining"},
    {"detail.monster.lore", "A jet-black corvid with a nasty beak and a reputation for heralding bad luck.\nMost ornithologists consider this a baseless stereotype; the rest are still\nrecovering from a series of staggeringly unlikely accidents.", "monster.lore.raven"},
    {"detail.monster.lore", "A large and vivid bloom drifting placidly upon the surface of the water. The\ncradle of the lotus's petals shine with eternity and elegance - while it is\nentirely harmless, it would take immense effort to destroy it.", "monster.lore.sacred_lotus"},
    {"detail.monster.lore", "A leftover mess of broken bones, inert grasping organs, and scattered skin.\nWhile some highly-specialised sorcerers might be capable of bringing it to life,\nit is otherwise harmless - the possible leftovers of some departed or\nabsent-minded magus.", "monster.lore.pile_of_flesh"},
    {"detail.monster.lore", "A lizard egg the size of a small boulder and nearly as hard. Perhaps as a\ndefence mechanism, they hatch rapidly in the presence of predators and even a\nnewborn can give all but the most ambitious of monsters a reason to consider an\neasier meal.", "monster.lore.seismosaurus_egg"},
    {"detail.monster.lore", "A lump of sickly pustulent flesh, dripping with lethal acid.", "monster.detail.lore.acid_blob_current"},
    {"detail.monster.lore", "A mannequin used for battle practice.", "monster.lore.training_dummy"},
    {"detail.monster.lore", "A mechanical insect powered by an intricate array of gears and springs. It has\nrun out of power and can only be rewound by its creator moving into it.", "monster.lore.dormant_clockwork_bee"},
    {"detail.monster.lore", "A mechanical insect powered by an intricate array of gears and springs. It is\nvicious and resilient to damage, but its clockwork naturally winds down as it\nattacks, eventually leaving it unable to move until its creator winds it again.", "monster.lore.clockwork_bee"},
    {"detail.monster.lore", "A minor hairy maggot spirit, phasing in and out of this plane. Each regional\nvariant inflicts different minor ailments: the ones found in the Dungeon\ncause one's magic to grow weak.", "monster.lore.bes_kemwar"},
    {"detail.monster.lore", "A minor servant of living shadow whose form wavers perpetually on the edge of\nrecognition - as if an unseen light were flickering behind something almost\nfamiliar.\n\nThe strength of its attacks increases in proportion with the power of the spell\nwhich summoned it.", "monster.lore.shadow_puppet"},
    {"detail.monster.lore", "A mobile and combat-capable alchemical manufactory that uses the friction of\nmelee combat to brew a variety of useful potions. When it has built up enough\nheat to complete its synthesis, it will automatically dispense the finished\npotions to nearby allies and fall apart.", "monster.lore.walking_alembic"},
    {"detail.monster.lore", "A modern breakthrough in arcane experimentation, this mobile prison cell\nweaponises the living fragments of once-escaped ugly things, extending the reach\nof their tendrils to thrash multiple foes at once from a distance.", "monster.lore.crawling_flesh_cage"},
    {"detail.monster.lore", "A mote of intense light and heat manifested by a sun scarab. It is linked to\ntheir essence and will never leave their side, being reconstituted time and time\nagain whenever it is extinguished.\n\nSome myths even claim that the sun which shines down upon the outside world was\nonce carried around by such a scarab.", "monster.lore.solar_ember"},
    {"detail.monster.lore", "A multihued mire of roiling flesh and fluctuating sludge, striving and failing\nfor more coherence than any other slime. As a fresh carrier of the ruinous\ncontagion that overtook the Slime Pits, it can impart unto others the same\nhorrible fate. While it may not be a permanent transformation for you, the\nmelding of weapons and armour, as well as the severe weakening of spells, may\nmake it a lethal one regardless.", "monster.lore.morphogenic_ooze"},
    {"detail.monster.lore", "A particularly rich and golden gelatinous thing. Smaller jellies swim and pulse just below its surface, ready to burst forth at the slightest touch.", "monster.lore.royal_jelly"},
    {"detail.monster.lore", "A prism-like silhouette which wavers with barely-contained destructive energy.\nAny blow which disrupts its form will result in a violent blast of shadow.", "monster.lore.shadow_prism"},
    {"detail.monster.lore", "A quivering amalgam of viscous slime, its many pseudopods gnashing at the air\nlike a throng of reptilian maws. It rapidly absorbs nearby slime creatures into\nitself, growing a new 'head' for each one and becoming even more resilient.\n\nWhether through convergent evolution or genetic memory, it also shares the\nhydra's most infamous trait: lopping off a head with a bladed weapon will just\nmake it grow two more unless the wound is cauterised by a flaming weapon.\n\nWhen not stalking prey, its constituent slimes may separate from it again,\nperhaps to seek new food sources on their own.", "monster.lore.slymdra"},
    {"detail.monster.lore", "A rapidly-growing mushroom whose life-cycle culminates in an explosive release\nof spores. These spores have a mild psychoactive effect and can sometimes daze\ncreatures who breathe them in.", "monster.lore.burstshroom"},
    {"detail.monster.lore", "A roiling sphere of intense destructive energies, drawn from the fabric of the\nHells themselves. It pursues a designated target inexorably, growing in size as\nit travels. If it collides with either a creature or wall, it will explode\nviolently - though its creator is protected from the wild destruction unleashed\nas it does so.", "monster.lore.globe_of_annihilation"},
    {"detail.monster.lore", "A scornful scion to whom even other vampires bend the knee. Their command over\nblood magic allows them to feed upon the lifeforce of entire armies at once.", "monster.lore.vampire_bloodprince"},
    {"detail.monster.lore", "A self-styled monarch of a shambling black alder, half respected and half\nridiculed by other fae. It backs up its aspirations to sovereignty with\nunearthly vile magic quite close to a touch of death.", "monster.lore.alderking"},
    {"detail.monster.lore", "A serrated disc forged of razor-sharp material. It spins in place at high\nvelocity, shredding through flesh and metal alike.", "monster.lore.diamond_sawblade"},
    {"detail.monster.lore", "A sizeable and statuesque flower, fossilised either by bitter grief or the cruel\ngrace of divinity, standing in its own eternal vigil.", "monster.lore.petrified_flower"},
    {"detail.monster.lore", "A skull-masked kobold, its body mutated by forbidden magics. It conducts vile\nexperiments in the service of demonic powers, formulating ever more terrible\nmonstrosities as vessels for devilish minds.", "monster.lore.kobold_fleshcrafter"},
    {"detail.monster.lore", "A slime mold colony in an early phase of its life cycle. Not yet mature enough\nto reproduce, it can still defend itself by firing globs of potent acid.", "monster.lore.nascent_plasmodium"},
    {"detail.monster.lore", "A small and strangely serpentine fold in space and time. Scholars once\ntheorised the Dungeon's easy access to manifold unholy realms is due to the\ntunneling of yet-undiscovered translocations dragons. Whether or not this is\ntrue, distant stars mottle this drake's endless lengths, and dimensions bend to\nits writhing whim.", "monster.lore.wyrmhole"},
    {"detail.monster.lore", "A small metal sphere surrounding a core of dormant fire magic. When given the\nproper command, it will detonate in a blast of metal and flame that is only\npartially affected by fire resistance.", "monster.lore.bomblet"},
    {"detail.monster.lore", "A spire of strangely tenebrous ice, its brittle tendrils reaching skyward like\nthe fingers of an outstretched hand. {\n    if spells.memorised(\"rimeblight\") then\n        return \"If only the dying breath of every soul could create such art.\"\n    else\n        return \"It might even be beautiful if you didn't know the gruesome \" ..\n               \"way it formed.\"\n    end\n}", "monster.lore.pillar_of_rime"},
    {"detail.monster.lore", "A spriggan that has mastered the culinary arts.", "monster.lore.spriggan_baker"},
    {"detail.monster.lore", "A strange stone-scaled fish that swims through solid rock with the same ease\nthat most fish do through water.", "monster.lore.rock_fish"},
    {"detail.monster.lore", "A strangely static silhouette whose form suggests a large cannon. Though it uses\nno gunpowder, the depths of its bore flickers angrily with every shot, as if\nremembering the fiery light of its ignition.", "monster.lore.shadow_turret"},
    {"detail.monster.lore", "A stubborn and fiercely territorial lizard with the strength of a mountain. Its\nthunderous footfalls herald violent tremors.", "monster.lore.seismosaurus"},
    {"detail.monster.lore", "A swirling tempest of souls and steel: knights and blacksmiths and\nweaponmasters, all bound to weapons they once held in life. To fight one is like\nfighting an entire army.", "monster.lore.undying_armoury"},
    {"detail.monster.lore", "A terrifying weapon hewn from molten rock. It rains fiery destruction down upon\nits creators' enemies.", "monster.lore.hellfire_mortar"},
    {"detail.monster.lore", "A territorial gnarl of driftwood and shattered bones. Its resentment of the\nliving has slowly twisted its remains into a monstrous form, capable of\nbrandishing weapons and spreading terrible curses.", "monster.lore.draugr"},
    {"detail.monster.lore", "A time-lost revenant, risen not from the death of a single individual but of\nmany - its bones fused together from the young and the elderly and different\nspecies altogether. Whether they were all the victims of a single massacre or\na thousand souls discarded over a thousand years is impossible to say now;\nhistory does not remember them.\n\nBut one thing is clear: they will fight to change that until every last memory\nthey have left burns away.", "monster.lore.nobody"},
    {"detail.monster.lore", "A timeworn revenant whose flames dance with the silhouettes of long-forgotten\natrocities. Cursed with a hunger they can never satisfy, they unleash these\nlong-dead echoes to reenact violence upon any soul they deem worthy of adding to\ntheir eternal collection.", "monster.lore.revenant_soulmonger"},
    {"detail.monster.lore", "A tiny fragment of a living soul, splintered from the body in which it belongs.\nToo mindless to be fully controlled, it seeks nothing but to reunite with its\ngreater self once more - unfortunately, this process tends to be more violent\nthan the magic which created it.", "monster.lore.soul_wisp"},
    {"detail.monster.lore", "A vampiric thrall bound into servitude by esoteric rituals. Though its rigid limbs give it an awkward gait, it moves with surprising speed, leaping upon its victims and leeching away their life essence with its vicious claws.", "monster.detail.lore.jiangshi_current"},
    {"detail.monster.lore", "A well-armoured coglin whose talents with machinery have been harnessed by the\nIronbound order to repair and augment the many constructs that help guard the\nVaults.", "monster.lore.ironbound_mechanist"},
    {"detail.monster.lore", "A white gelatinous mound that pulses with a strange iridescence. Its body\nabsorbs magical energy like a sponge, and when sufficiently injured, will\nunleash this energy as a flurry of shooting stars.", "monster.lore.star_jelly"},
    {"detail.monster.lore", "A wicked youthful hybrid with a woman's head, a lion's body, and the wings of\nan eagle. It gleefully wreaks havoc with both the violent turbulence of\nhigh winds and the frustration of bewildering magics.", "monster.lore.sphinx_marauder"},
    {"detail.monster.lore", "A wily kobold who has learned to weaponise every crack and crevice that lines\nthe walls of its domain.", "monster.lore.kobold_geomancer"},
    {"detail.monster.lore", "A wizened, headless corpse, animated not by conventional necromancy but by the\nmournful malice of dead stars. Its psychic eyes, floating disjointedly from its\nbody's movements, relentlessly burrow through its victims' minds.", "monster.lore.cognitogaunt"},
    {"detail.monster.lore", "An elegant siege weapon, magically sculpted from crystalline ice. As ephemeral\nas a summer snowstorm, every salvo it fires consumes a portion of itself until\nnothing is left behind but water.", "monster.lore.hoarfrost_cannon"},
    {"detail.monster.lore", "An enormous and unnervingly motile slime mold colony. It creeps along the\ncrevices of the walls in search of nutrients and can spread itself to new\nlocations by launching enormous sporangia.", "monster.lore.creeping_plasmodium"},
    {"detail.monster.lore", "An enormous land tortoise whose shell is so thick and rock-encrusted that\nsleeping ones are frequently mistaken for geological formations. And like a\nmountain, its exterior is nearly impervious to any destructive force; only at\nclose range can one properly aim for the narrow gaps between its plates to\nstrike the tender flesh within.", "monster.lore.mountainshell"},
    {"detail.monster.lore", "An experienced, armoured and well-armed orc soldier, able to command a small mob of its fellows.", "monster.detail.lore.orc_warrior_current"},
    {"detail.monster.lore", "An impossible shape that scintillates with unearthly colour. The power of Zot\nflows heavily through it, overlaying this reality with countless others where\nits domain remains pristine.\n\nEach tesseract is inextricably linked to the other, and destroying one will\ndestroy both (and expel all the creatures they have beckoned to this reality,\nas well as dazing even those which they have not). But so long as they are\nallowed to exist, there will be no end to the forces which seek to keep you from\nthe Orb.", "monster.lore.boundless_tesseract"},
    {"detail.monster.lore", "An infamous, dutiful retainer of Gehenna. These immense and indomitable oni\nweave their weapons through reality itself to reach and capture the innumerable\ndamned souls owed to the hells upon their deaths.", "monster.lore.oni_incarcerator"},
    {"detail.monster.lore", "An intricate mechanical beetle covered in reinforced metal plates that resemble\na shield. It projects a kinetic barrier around its creator while adjacent to\nthem, increasing their armour class.\n\nIt will never voluntarily leave its creator's side, and if forcibly seperated,\nwill prioritise returning to them over any other concerns.", "monster.lore.phalanx_beetle"},
    {"detail.monster.lore", "An irritable, bristling shrub. It fends off anything that might graze upon it by\nlaunching some of its innumerable toxic stinging hairs.", "monster.lore.scrub_nettle"},
    {"detail.monster.lore", "An orcish wayfarer who has been touched by the hand of Beogh. Whether out of\nreligious devotion or personal jealousy, they have come to bar your path.\n\nHold nothing back - for neither they nor their followers will do so.\n\nGlory to Beogh!", "monster.lore.orc_apostle"},
    {"detail.monster.lore", "An ordinary piece of armour, held in your haunting grip. It can attack nearby\nenemies, but must return to your side if you ever stray too far from it.", "monster.lore.haunted_armour"},
    {"detail.monster.lore", "An unfathomably massive pile of mystic pulsating protoplasm. The slightest\nthreat will cause it to undergo rapid weaponised mitosis, rapidly overwhelming\npotential meals in a cytoplasmic tidal wave.", "monster.lore.colossal_amoeba"},
    {"detail.monster.lore", "An upright feliform trickster of an elderly demon, with a forked tail ablaze\nwith a shimmering haze. It holds a deep disdain for mortal humanoids, a\npatronising pity for mortal cats, and enough mystic might to subjugate both.", "monster.lore.nekomata"},
    {"detail.monster.lore", "As a young woman, Cassandra bound herself in service to Ashenzari and was\nblessed and cursed in equal measure - granted the ability to foresee disasters,\nbut only those she was powerless to prevent.\n\nEventually driven from her homeland as a harbinger of the very plagues she'd\nspent a lifetime warning against, she has come to the dungeon in her final days\nin hope of averting one last catastrophe.", "monster.lore.cassandra"},
    {"detail.monster.lore", "Goblin clans fractured over the advent of steel exoskeletons long ago, prompting\nan experimental arms race for goblin hegemony. Some volunteered to join forces\nwith other species, an alliance that has enabled capturing and taming wyverns.\nFrom uptop their majestic dragon-like mounts, these goblins swiftly soar about\nand skewer those who intrude upon their allies' domain.", "monster.lore.goblin_rider"},
    {"detail.monster.lore", "It has been centuries since outsiders were last allowed access to the cavernous\nlibraries of the formicids, but their emissaries are still seen from time to\ntime - surveying other lands for resources or scientific discoveries that might\naid the colony.\n\nThis one's study of the magical fibres excreted by orb spiders has already led\nto an alchemical breakthrough, allowing them to shape fulminant prisms such that\ntheir explosions are directed at enemies alone. Alas, their enthusiasm to\nconduct a field test bodes poorly for your health.", "monster.lore.xak_krixis"},
    {"detail.monster.lore", "Many poltergeists are fiercely territorial over the domains they choose to\nhaunt, but these have extended that protection even to the people who share\ntheir domain with them. Some say they must be the lingering souls of those who\nguarded the Vaults in life; others suggest the Ironbound Order simply recruited\nthem in common cause. Whichever is true, their very presence shelters other\ncreatures from missiles, causing sling and spell alike to veer off-course at the\nlast moment.", "monster.lore.polterguardian"},
    {"detail.monster.lore", "Once a gangly and bedraggled vampire with a strange obsession with colour,\nBlorkula was offered succour by a missionary of Beogh and became a portly and\nvigorous orc with a strange obsession with colour instead.\n\nHe wields magic tinged with every hue of the rainbow, and has mastered the art\nof dividing his own form among its many colours to avoid killing blows - though\neven he must rest a while before doing so a second time.", "monster.lore.blorkula_the_orcula"},
    {"detail.monster.lore", "Some sorcerers care little for unholy realms or undead forms, seeking power\ninstead in the whims of cruel chaos. This ominous owl-winged head is all that\nremains of a former archmage: it delights in spreading misfortune and drinking\nblood in its new airborne form.", "monster.lore.chonchon"},
    {"detail.monster.lore", "The Dungeon's vast repositories of the dead and the unholy realms thereafter\nboth require regular restocking and reorganisation, far beyond the coordination\nof the restless dead. These corpse-collecting constructs burrow through the\nearth and command divisions of zombified hands to assist them in stealing away\ncarrion, and may also violently create new corpses for such purposes.", "monster.lore.undertaker"},
    {"detail.monster.lore", "The flame-wreathed skeleton of a carnivorous fish, darting through air as easily\nas it once parted water. It burns with a hunger it could not satisfy in life and\nis singularly driven by in death.\n\nWhile a single one may be only a nuisance, the swarm is never far behind, and\nevery bite it lands will summon more and more of them until every scrap of flesh\non its prey has been devoured.", "monster.lore.marrowcuda"},
    {"detail.monster.quote", "“On the other hand, Confucius is made to say to his disciples, ‘I know how\n birds can fly, how fishes can swim, and how animals can run. But the runner\n may be snared, the swimmer may be hooked, and the flyer may be shot by the\n arrow. But there is the dragon. I cannot tell how he mounts on the wind\n through the clouds, and rises to heaven. Today I have seen Lao-tsze, and can\n only compare him to the dragon.’”\n    -Life of Confucius\n\n“This Dragon had Two furious Wings\n   Each one upon each Shoulder;\n With a Sting in his Tail as long as a Flail,\n   Which made him bolder and bolder.\n He had long Claws, and in his Jaws\n   Four and forty Teeth of Iron;\n With a Hide as tough, as any Buff,\n   Which did him round environ.”\n\n    -“An Excellent Ballad of a most dreadful Combat, fought between Moore of Moore-Hall, and the Dragon of Wantley”, retold by Ambrose Philips, _A Collection of Old Ballads. Corrected from the Best and Most Ancient Copies Extant. With Introductions Historical, Critical, Or Humorous_. 1723.", "monster.quote.cap_d_suffix"},
    {"detail.monster.quote", "“Things are only mannequins and even the great world-historical events are only\n costumes beneath which they exchange glances with nothingness, with the base\n and the banal.”\n    -Walter Benjamin, _Protocols to the Experiments on Hashish, Opium and\n     Mescaline 1927-1934_, “Protocol II: Highlights of the Second Hashish\n     Impression”. 15 January 1928.\n     trans. Scott J. Thompson, 1997.", "monster.quote.training_dummy"},
    {"detail.monster.status_reference", "[[asleep monstatus]]", "monster.status_reference.1"},
    {"detail.monster.status_reference", "[[catching its breath monstatus]]", "monster.status_reference.2"},
    {"detail.monster.status_reference", "[[contaminated monstatus]]", "monster.status_reference.3"},
    {"detail.monster.status_reference", "[[high-tier stab monstatus]]", "monster.status_reference.4"},
    {"detail.monster.status_reference", "[[low-tier stab monstatus]]", "monster.status_reference.5"},
    {"detail.monster.status_reference", "[[paralysed monstatus]]", "monster.status_reference.6"},
    {"detail.monster.status_reference", "[[sharing its pain monstatus]]", "monster.status_reference.7"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "<blue>Melee attacks you make against this creature have a chance (proportional to\nyour stealth and weapon skill) of catching it off-guard and dealing\nincreased damage, especially if made with a short blade.</blue>", "monster.status_text.low_tier_stab"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "<blue>Melee attacks you make against this creature will deal greatly increased damage,\nespecially if made with a short blade.</blue>", "monster.status_text.high_tier_stab"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "A fragment of this creature's soul has been extracted into a soul wisp,\npreventing further use of this spell until the wisp reunites with them again.", "monster.status_text.soul_splintered"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "After a short delay, this creature will be teleported to somewhere else on the\ncurrent floor.", "monster.status_text.about_to_teleport"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "Despite being engulfed in unnatural silence, this creature's magic does not\nrequire vocalisations and thus is unaffected.", "monster.status_text.unaffected_by_silence"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "Each turn, this creature blinks a short distance further away from you and\nsuffers a small amount of damage.", "monster.status_text.untethered_in_space"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "Half of the damage suffered by this creature is redirected to the ally protecting it\ninstead.", "monster.status_text.sheltered_from_injuries"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature cannot blink or teleport.", "monster.status_text.unable_to_translocate"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature cannot move under its own power, but may still use translocations\nor be forcibly displaced by someone else.", "monster.status_text.bound_in_place"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature cannot see properly. Its accuracy is greatly decreased, it cannot\nmake attacks of opportunity, and spells it casts may sometimes be aimed at the\nwrong locations.\n\nIt may also stumble around and eventually lose track of its target, especially\nif it has low intelligence.\n\n[[low-tier stab monstatus]]", "monster.status_text.blind"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature deals 50% more damage with melee attacks and both moves and\nattacks 50% faster. It cannot cast spells and will prioritise attacking the\nclosest other creature present each turn, whether they are friend or foe.", "monster.status_text.frenzied_and_wild"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature has +15 EV when dodging projectiles, whether physical or magical.", "monster.status_text.repelling_missiles"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature has 50% more health, deals 50% more damage with melee attacks, and\nboth moves and acts 50% faster. They cannot perform any action besides moving\nor attacking.\n\nWhen the berserk rage wears off, they will be slowed and unable to berserk for a\nshort duration.", "monster.status_text.berserk"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature has become unmoored in space, allowing it to Manifold Assault as\na natural ability. Whenever they do, there is 33% chance they will also blink\nto a random nearby location.", "monster.status_text.touched_by_paradox"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature has been afflicted with illusory wounds by a flayed ghost. These wounds\nwill disappear with time or when the flayed ghost is destroyed.", "monster.status_text.covered_in_terrible_wounds"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature has been briefly distracted by something else.\n\n[[low-tier stab monstatus]]", "monster.status_text.not_watching_you"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature has been charmed and will fight for your cause for a short while. This\neffect will wear off immediately if you attempt to harm it in any way.", "monster.status_text.charmed"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature has been coated in sticky flame, and will take AC-ignoring fire damage\neach turn. Movement will shake off the flames, causing it to expire much more\nrapidly and stepping into water will extinguish it entirely.", "monster.status_text.covered_in_liquid_flames"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature has been condemned to inexorable decay and ruin. Whenever it takes\ndamage from melee attacks, it will be drained heavily and either slowed, weakened,\nor blinded.", "monster.status_text.marked_with_the_sign_of_ruin"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature has been contaminated by transmutational energy, and will suffer\nsignificant damage every third time such energy is inflicted upon them.", "monster.status_text.contaminated"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature has been created by magic and will cease to be once its creator dies.", "monster.status_text.minion"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature has been defeated in honourable combat and may be recruited as\none of your apostles via the ability menu.", "monster.status_text.ready_to_become_your_apostle"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature has been driven to madness by the power of Zin. It will never again\nuse spells or abilities and will stumble around at random, attacking whatever\nit bumps into - be they friend or foe or sometimes even themselves.", "monster.status_text.lost_in_madness"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature has been empowered by the flames of Ignis. It deals additional\nfire damage with its melee attacks, moves 33% more quickly, and has increased AC\nand resistance to fire.", "monster.status_text.flame_wreathed"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature has been flash-frozen and its movement speed is greatly reduced for\na short time.", "monster.status_text.encased_in_ice"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature has been granted great power by Beogh to challenge you. Their melee\nand ranged attacks deal 33% more damage, their health is increased, and they cast\nspells more frequently. They are also able to track you, no matter where on the\ncurrent floor you flee.\n\nThey will lose these bonuses once the challenge is concluded.", "monster.status_text.empowered_by_the_touch_of_beogh"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature has been heavily drained, lowering the accuracy of their melee\nattacks, the power of their spells and special attack properties, and making\nthem more vulnerable to many status effects.", "monster.status_text.heavily_drained"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature has been lightly drained, somewhat lowering the accuracy of their\nmelee attacks, the power of their spells and special attack properties, and\nmaking them slightly more vulnerable to many status effects.", "monster.status_text.lightly_drained"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature has been magically vexed and is forced to attack a random adjacent\nspace each turn instead of performing any other actions. It is more likely to\nattack a space containing a creature than an empty one, but will attack its own\nallies as readily as its enemies.", "monster.status_text.lashing_out_in_frustration"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature has been ordered to flee in a given direction, and will not attack\nor return to your side until they are given new instructions or have travelled a\nsufficient distance", "monster.status_text.retreating"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature has been outlined with a halo of light and is easier to hit and\nrevealed, if invisible.", "monster.status_text.softly_glowing"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature has been roused into great speed by the wrath of Gozag Ym Sagoz.\nTheir haste or berserk state is permanent and will not wear off with time\nor through deliberate magical intervention.", "monster.status_text.incited_by_gozag"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature has been stricken permanently mute by the power of Zin. This\nprevents all noise the creature could make, including the vocalisations\nrequired for most creatures to cast spells.", "monster.status_text.mute"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature has been struck dumb by the power of Zin and cannot act.\n\n[[high-tier stab monstatus]]", "monster.status_text.stupefied"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature has been struck with a kinetic grapnel. The next melee attack\nfrom the grapnel's source will always hit and deal slightly increased damage.", "monster.status_text.grapneled"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature has built up part of the charge it needs to cast a spell or\nactivate an ability.", "monster.status_text.partially_charged"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature has contributed to the death of one of your apostles. Defeating all\ntargets of orcish vengeance will significantly speed up the time it takes for\nBeogh to resurrect your apostles.", "monster.status_text.target_of_orcish_vengeance"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature has curled into a ball, increasing its movement speed and melee\ndamage by 100% until the next time it attacks something (or becomes unable to move).", "monster.status_text.rolling"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature has gathered all the power it needs to cast its spells.", "monster.status_text.fully_charged"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature has glows with the perfection of their best self. They deal 100%\nmore damage with melee attacks, have additional AC, and cast spells with\nsubstantially more strength.", "monster.status_text.idealised"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature has had its access to magic tainted. Whenever it casts a spell, its\nmagic will be severely disrupted, making it likely any subsequent spells it casts\nwill fail.", "monster.status_text.magic_sapped"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature has mesmerised you, making you unable to voluntarily move away\nfrom them.\n\nThis effect will break if you ever lose sight of this creature.", "monster.status_text.mesmerising"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature has not yet inflicted you with Oblivion Howl and may attempt to do so.", "monster.status_text.ready_to_howl"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature has recently cast Polar Vortex and cannot cast it again for\na short time.", "monster.status_text.surrounded_by_restless_winds"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature has temporarily gained the ability to cast specific spells.\nIt will lose access to them again once sufficiently injured.", "monster.status_text.ablaze_with_memories"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature has used a breath ability recently and cannot use it again for a\nshort while.", "monster.status_text.catching_its_breath"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature is being constricted by clutching corpses from deep beneath the\nearth, which reduces their evasion and inflicts some damage each turn. It may also\nprevent them from moving, though each attempt to do so has a chance to break this\neffect entirely.", "monster.status_text.constricted_by_zombie_hands"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature is being constricted by tree roots, which reduces their evasion and\ninflicts some damage each turn. It may also prevent them from moving, though each\nattempt to do so has a chance to break this effect entirely.", "monster.status_text.constricted_by_roots"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature is being targeted by one or more of your allies.", "monster.status_text.ally_target"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature is but a fragile duplicate of another creature. Its health is\nreduced by 66%, it deals 33% less damage with attacks, and its spells are\nsignificantly weakened.", "monster.status_text.feeble_figment"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature is caught in a net, greatly reducing its evasion and preventing it\nfrom blocking. Any attempt it makes to move or attack will instead struggle against\nthe net, which may eventually destroy it. Spellcasting is unimpaired.\n\n[[low-tier stab monstatus]]", "monster.status_text.entangled_in_a_net"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature is caught in a spider's web, greatly reducing its evasion and\npreventing it from blocking. Any attempt it makes to move or attack will instead\nstruggle against the web, which may eventually destroy it. Spellcasting is\nunimpaired.\n\n[[low-tier stab monstatus]]", "monster.status_text.entangled_in_a_web"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature is chanting a Word of Recall. This will recall intelligent allies\nfrom elsewhere on the floor to the caster's vicinity after a short delay, but can\nbe interrupted by most effects which would normally prevent it from casting spells.", "monster.status_text.chanting_recall"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature is cursed, and will lose half its current health after the next time\nthe source of the curse hits it with a melee attack.", "monster.status_text.cursed_with_the_promise_of_agony"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature is engulfed in a field of unnatural silence, preventing any noise\nit might make, including the vocalisations required for many creatures to cast\nspells.", "monster.status_text.silenced"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature is fleeing in fear and will attempt each turn to move away from\nthe source of this fear. Beside movement, it may only cast spells which it\nthinks could help it escape, such as Blink.\n\nIf harmed directly or cornered against terrain, it will turn around to fight\nonce more.", "monster.status_text.fleeing"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature is infested with a death scarab, which will emerge from their\nbody once they die.", "monster.status_text.infested"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature is neither hostile nor allied and may attack creatures of all\ndispositions, should it wander into them.", "monster.status_text.indifferent"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature is normally invisible, but your magical sight allows you to see it\nnonetheless. This has no effect on you, though any allies you have may not be\nable to see it as you can.", "monster.status_text.slightly_transparent"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature is poisoned and will take damage every turn.", "monster.status_text.very_poisoned"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature is preparing to launch a clockwork bee and must focus on this\ntask for several turns. Most effects that would prevent this creature from\ncasting spells will also interrupt this process.", "monster.status_text.winding_a_clockwork_bee"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature is preventing any clouds from being created on the current floor.", "monster.status_text.stilling_the_winds"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature is sick and cannot naturally regenerate.", "monster.status_text.sick"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature is stuck in liquefied ground, causing it to move more slowly and also\nfumble 25% of the melee attacks it makes.", "monster.status_text.covering_ground_slowly"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature is surrounded by a field of unnatural silence which eliminates\nall noise made within it as well as preventing the vocalisations required for\nmany creatures (including you) to read scrolls, cast spells, or invoke divine\naid.\n\nIf this effect was caused by a spell, the radius of the field will shrink over\ntime.", "monster.status_text.radiating_silence"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature is temporarily unable to act, but any hostile action will cause it to\nimmediately regain its senses.", "monster.status_text.dazed"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature is the source of a devastating polar vortex.", "monster.status_text.surrounded_by_a_freezing_vortex"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature is unable to block or use spells or abilities and will stumble around\nat random, attacking whatever it bumps into - be they friend or foe or sometimes even\nthemselves.\n\n[[low-tier stab monstatus]]", "monster.status_text.confused"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature is unable to breathe and cannot cast spells or invoke divine aid.\nIt also takes minor asphyxiation damage every turn.", "monster.status_text.unable_to_breathe"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature is unable to evade attacks or turn invisible. If it dies, it will leave\nbehind a cloud of magnetised fragments.\n\nEach time Magnavolt is cast, a beam of electricity will automatically be fired at this\ncreature.", "monster.status_text.covered_in_magnetic_dust"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature is unable to move, act, block, or dodge attacks.\n\n[[high-tier stab monstatus]]", "monster.status_text.paralysed"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature is unable to move, act, block, or dodge attacks. By being made\nof stone, it also takes 50% less damage, gains immunity to negative energy and\npoison, but become vulnerable to deconstruction.\n\n[[high-tier stab monstatus]]", "monster.status_text.petrified"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature is unable to move, act, block, or dodge. Any hostile action will\nawaken it, though melee attacks against it (even by other monsters) will deal\nincreased damage.\n\n[[high-tier stab monstatus]]", "monster.status_text.asleep"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature is unable to see you because you are invisible. Its accuracy\nagainst you is greatly decreased, it cannot make attacks of opportunity, and\nspells it casts may sometimes be aimed at the wrong locations.\n\nIt may also stumble around and eventually lose track of you, especially if it\nhas low intelligence.\n\n[[low-tier stab monstatus]]", "monster.status_text.unable_to_see_you"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature moves and acts 50% faster.", "monster.status_text.fast"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature moves and acts at 66% of normal speed.", "monster.status_text.slow"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature moves slightly faster.", "monster.status_text.covering_ground_quickly"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature provides no experience or piety when slain.", "monster.status_text.unrewarding"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature receives 50% more damage from all sources.", "monster.status_text.fragile_as_glass"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature reflects any projectile it blocks back to their original source.", "monster.status_text.reflecting_blocked_projectiles"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature regenerates health at a greatly increased rate, proportion to their\nmaximum health.", "monster.status_text.regenerating"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature shines with Olgreb's Toxic Radiance and will continuously inflict\npoison damage on all foes in sight for several turns.", "monster.status_text.radiating_toxic_energy"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature suffers AC-ignoring cold damage every turn, and may sometimes\nexplode in a burst of ice that damages nearby allies. When it dies, it may\nspread rimeblight to other nearby allies.\n\nNatural, demonic, or holy creatures will be instantly killed once they reach\nlow health, and be replaced with pillars of rime.", "monster.status_text.afflicted_by_rimeblight"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature suffers poison damage every turn and cannot be poisoned any\nfurther.", "monster.status_text.extremely_poisoned"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature suffers poison damage every turn.", "monster.status_text.poisoned"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature takes no damage by any means unless the original source of that\ndamage is adjacent to them. Non-damaging side-effects happen normally.\n\n(The source of damage from clouds and projectile-like monsters, such as foxfires,\nis always considered whatever creature first created them.)", "monster.status_text.damage_immune_at_range"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature trails a ring of acidic fog clouds around itself.", "monster.status_text.surrounded_by_acidic_fog"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature trails a ring of clouds of excruciating misery around itself.", "monster.status_text.surrounded_by_negative_energy"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature trails a ring of flame clouds around itself.", "monster.status_text.surrounded_by_flames"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature trails a ring of foul miasma around itself.", "monster.status_text.surrounded_by_foul_miasma"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature trails a ring of freezing clouds around itself.", "monster.status_text.surrounded_by_freezing_clouds"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature trails a ring of mutagenic fog around itself.", "monster.status_text.surrounded_by_mutagenic_energy"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature trails a ring of purple smoke around itself.", "monster.status_text.surrounded_by_fog"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature trails a ring of seething chaos clouds around itself.", "monster.status_text.surrounded_by_chaotic_energy"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature trails a ring of thunder clouds around itself.", "monster.status_text.surrounded_by_thunder"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature will be automatically destroyed in a few turns.", "monster.status_text.crumbling_away"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature will die in a few turns.", "monster.status_text.withering_away"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature will inflict a portion of all damage it suffers upon nearby allies,\nwith those closer to it receiving a greater amount.", "monster.status_text.sharing_its_pain"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature will never attack you and may attack other creatures hostile to\nyou, but will neither follow you nor obey any direct instructions.", "monster.status_text.peaceful"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature will soon become fully petrified. Its movement and actions are\n50% slower and it is nearly unable to dodge attacks, though it also takes 33%\nless damage.\n\n[[low-tier stab monstatus]]", "monster.status_text.petrifying_slowly"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature will take minor damage whenever it moves.", "monster.status_text.skewered_by_barbs"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature's AC is reduced by 8 and its accuracy, spell power, brand damage, and\nwillpower are moderately reduced.", "monster.status_text.misshapen_and_mutated"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature's AC is reduced by 8.", "monster.status_text.corroded"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature's Sundering weapon is fully charged and its next attack will be\nmore accurate, inflict greatly increased damage, and cleave with increased range.\nThis effect will be lost if it moves.", "monster.status_text.ready_to_sunder"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature's evasion is slightly increased.", "monster.status_text.unusually_agile"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature's fire resistance is reduced by one level.", "monster.status_text.more_vulnerable_to_fire"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature's melee attacks deal 25% more damage, its accuracy is slightly\nincreased, and its spells and abilities have been mildly strengthened.", "monster.status_text.tempered"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature's melee attacks deal 33% less damage.", "monster.status_text.weak"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature's melee attacks deal 50% more damage.", "monster.status_text.strong"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature's melee attacks may inflict additional damage of a random element\nor cause various irresistible status effects.", "monster.status_text.interlaced_with_chaos"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature's natural venom has been intensified, giving any poison it inflicts\nthrough attacks or breath weapons a chance to slow and asphyxiate susceptible targets.", "monster.status_text.concentrated_venom"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature's poison resistance is reduced by one level.", "monster.status_text.more_vulnerable_to_poison"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature's resistance to fire, cold, poison, electricity, and corrosion\nare all increased by one level.", "monster.status_text.unusually_resistant"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature's shadow has been torn away from it and cannot be affected\nby Aphotic Marionette ever again.", "monster.status_text.missing_a_shadow"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature's soul has been bound in ice. When it dies, a simulacrum of its\noriginal form will rise in its place.", "monster.status_text.soul_bound"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature's soul will be bound in service to you once they die, though\nallowing them to stray from your line of sight for more than a brief moment\nwill cause you to lose your grasp on it.", "monster.status_text.soul_gripped"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature's spells and magical abilities have been disrupted and may fail when\nused. The chance of failure depends on the remaining duration of this effect.", "monster.status_text.magic_disrupted"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature's spells are less powerful - dealing less damage, being less able to\novercome their target's willpower, and occasionally being weaker in other ways.", "monster.status_text.diminished_spells"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature's spells are significantly weakened.", "monster.status_text.spells_diminished"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature's spells are strengthened and it will cast them more frequently.", "monster.status_text.spells_empowered"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature's willpower is increased by 2 pips.", "monster.status_text.strong_willed"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature's willpower is reduced by half.", "monster.status_text.weak_willed"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This formerly-friendly creature has been charmed by another creature to join their\nside. If you slay the source of this charm, it will regain its senses.", "monster.status_text.control_wrested_from_you"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This monster has been called from a parallel reality. Killing it will grant no\nexperience points, but it will be immediately cast back to its original reality\nas soon as the tesseract is destroyed.", "monster.status_text.called_by_a_tesseract"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This monster's current and maximum health are temporarily doubled.", "monster.status_text.doubled_in_vigour"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "When this creature deals damage, it will suffer damage equal to the damage it\ndealt.", "monster.status_text.anguished"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "Whenever this creature suffers damage, a flame cloud will briefly appear\nbeneath them. When they die, they will explode in a violent burst of fire,\ndamaging anything nearby and leaving behind additional flame clouds.\n\nGiant creatures will trigger an even larger explosion when they die.", "monster.status_text.inner_flame"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "Whenever this creature suffers damage, it inflicts 2/3rds as much damage back upon\nwhatever damaged it.", "monster.status_text.reflecting_injuries"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "Whenever you perform a ranged attack aimed at a different creature, a copy of\nthe projectile will be teleported to this creature at the end of its flight.", "monster.status_text.targeted_by_your_dimensional_bullseye"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "You are currently terrified of this creature, preventing you from deliberately\nmoving close to them and causing 33% of the melee attacks you make again\nagainst them fail.\n\nThis effect will break if you ever lose sight of this creature.", "monster.status_text.inspiring_fear"},
